#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:1
msgid "E0079"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `implicit_impl_as_method`"
msgstr "警告名称：`implicit_impl_as_method`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:5
msgid ""
"Methods from an `impl Trait for Type` declaration are being attached to "
"`Type` implicitly. This compatibility behavior is deprecated because it "
"is not explicit or refactoring-safe."
msgstr "`impl Trait for Type` 声明中的方法被隐式附加到了 `Type`。这种兼容行为不够明确，也不利于安全重构，因此已弃用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:9
msgid ""
"This diagnostic describes the former implicit-attachment compatibility "
"behavior. Without an explicitly attached method, current toolchains "
"report [E4015](E4015.md) instead."
msgstr "此诊断描述的是以前隐式附加方法的兼容行为。如果没有显式附加方法，当前工具链会改为报告 [E4015](E4015.md)。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:13
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0079.md:15
msgid ""
"Use `extend Type with Trait::{method}` for methods that should support "
"dot syntax. If the compatibility method should remain available only for "
"migration, mark that `extend` declaration with `#deprecated`. Otherwise, "
"call the implementation as `Trait::method(value)`."
msgstr "对于需要支持点语法的方法，使用 `extend Type with Trait::{method}`。如果兼容方法只需在迁移期内保留，请在对应的 `extend` 声明上添加 `#deprecated`；否则以 `Trait::method(value)` 调用实现。"
